{"availability":"available","full":"shivaumsharma/FinSight-AI","name":"FinSight-AI","description":"AI-powered autonomous equity research platform integrating DCF valuation, FCFF forecasting, FinBERT sentiment analysis, ChromaDB RAG pipelines, and Streamlit-based financial intelligence dashboards using live market data.","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-20T11:40:09Z","updated":"2026-10-08T22:00:38Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://web-ten-blond-39.vercel.app","topics":["dcf-valuation","equity-research","financial-ai","fintech","llm","rag","streamlit"],"demo":"https://web-ten-blond-39.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:42.183Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:42.183Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:42.183Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:42.183Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An agentic equity-research and paper-trading platform built using Python, FastAPI, Next.js, and a self-hosted or hosted LLM backend to plan, retrieve, value, and write institutional-style research on any publicly listed company — grounded in live market data and real SEC/NSE filings, not the model's training data.","The platform combines an LLM tool-planning agent, a real DCF valuation engine, retrieval-augmented generation over live regulatory filings, a self-evaluation scoring pass, a 31-signal quantitative factor scorecard, a simulated paper-trading layer, voice input, and a rigorously benchmarked evaluation framework into one deployable, tested system."],"features":["LLM planning agent that decides which tools a question actually needs (a valuation question skips RAG; a \"what did management say\" question skips the DCF)","Real DCF valuation: WACC → FCFF forecast → enterprise value → intrinsic value, with a 5×5 sensitivity grid and 2,000-sample Monte Carlo simulation","Retrieval-augmented generation over live SEC EDGAR filings (US tickers) and live NSE India corporate announcements (.NS tickers) — cited, not paraphrased from training data","FinBERT sentiment scoring, run separately over filing tone and recent news tone","Self-evaluation pass: every report scores its own grounding, retrieval quality, citation coverage, and completeness before it's shown to you"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivaumsharma/FinSight-AI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"691e3cfe6a13371b3c101026daa6264fff9c1a516a35a23ce78ae37e55232778","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:42.343Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:42.343Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An agentic equity-research and paper-trading platform built using Python, FastAPI, Next.js, and a self-hosted or hosted LLM backend to plan, retrieve, value, and write institutional-style research on any publicly listed company — grounded in live market data and real SEC/NSE filings, not the model's training data.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivaumsharma/FinSight-AI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"APIKEY is required before this is exposed anywhere public.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivaumsharma/FinSight-AI/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Alternative: Railway — the committed Dockerfile/railway.json support a one-service Railway deploy for the API (railway login, railway init, attach a persistent volume for jobs.db/reports/, railway variables set ... for each .env.example key, railway up).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivaumsharma/FinSight-AI/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Redeem the DigitalOcean credit from the GitHub Student Developer Pack (education.github.com → Student Pack → DigitalOcean offer), which requires a DigitalOcean account with a payment method on file even though the credit covers the cost.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shivaumsharma/FinSight-AI/b